  "title": "tap-sipstat: improve memory management",
  "description": "Add a finish function to the call of `register_tap_listener()` which\nfrees the memory allocated by the tap. This includes the tap data\nallocated upon registration, as well as the filter string and the\n`hash_requests` and `hash_responses` hash tables.\n\nCreate those tables using `g_hash_table_new_full()`, passing `g_free`\nas the destroy functions for the keys and values, so GLib will free the\nmemory we allocate for them.\n\nPing #20432",
